+Super rally exterior
+
+Based on "Dodge Challenger HellCat - Rigged" by Richerworld.
+Source: https://blendswap.com/blend/26927
+Author: Richerworld (see the model listing above).
+Licence: Creative Commons Attribution (CC-BY).
+BlendSwap's published licence mapping identifies CC-BY as CC BY 4.0:
+https://blendswap.com/3d-mcp-api/docs
+https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
+
+Beat my track modifications (2026-11-09): exterior simplified offline into two
+mesh tiers; geometry split into paint, glazing, trim, hood, aero, lamps and wheels;
+source studio, rig, animation, embedded texture maps, badges and cabin floor
+removed; native opaque windows and native game materials replace source shaders;
+rim geometry aligned with the existing Super rally contacts; existing native
+round tyre geometry replaces the source tyre meshes. Existing native
+game cosmetic parts adapted to the new exterior. No runtime rig or interior.
+
+The source author credits a Kevin Gallant modelling tutorial:
+https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H8Fo0mfyab0
+No endorsement by the artist, tutorial author or vehicle manufacturer is implied.
